  WrittenDialogue: "Thanks for visiting me and showing your puzzle skills.\nThis might sound corny but you really inspired me to do something with the feeling I still have.\nI can’t give up. Not yet anyway.\nDon’t be surprised if I surprise you. These flappy arms and legs are merely an illusion!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
